### Create a task
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Prepare for backend interview",
  "description": "Practice Spring Boot CRUD and explain trade-offs",
  "assigneeId": 1
}

### List tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks

### Filter tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks?status=TODO

### Get a task (replace UUID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/REPLACE_WITH_UUID

### Update a task (replace UUID)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/REPLACE_WITH_UUID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Prepare for backend interview",
  "description": "CRUD, validation, error handling, and outbound HTTP",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "assigneeId": 1
}

### Delete a task (replace UUID)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/REPLACE_WITH_UUID

### Call external test user API (requires internet)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/1

### Validation error
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "   "
}
